        dct:description "Pass 2: the GIF last frame scores cv_sim_similarity 90.7 against the culture-plate photograph (12 frames, 640x520). Beige colonies on a gold ground are the right pattern class for this plate. The photograph is a macroscopic plate, not a 64 µm field, and the agar illumination in the display transfer is not a biological field. KS = 0.453 on median-normalised diameters: the size distributions do not match, and that disagreement is left in the figure." ;
